Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying robes drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, thus, a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\NThen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\NAnd freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a good verse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.16,0:02:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It took a while, but we finally got\Nan eternal pose to Koala's hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Koala?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go back to your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents will be proud to see\Nwhat a fine young lady you become?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't look silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We got rid of those old rags of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want them back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You may feel awkward at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I promise, your mom will be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I should clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you gotta break that\Nweird habit of yours, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a normal girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't Marie Joie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, just let her do what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl was traumatized.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't expect her to stop that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,These things take time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.22,0:03:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.13,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You should listen to Aladdin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He would know. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were a slave\Nonce yourself, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But those feelings might be\Nbetter served if you killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Former slave or not, she's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the ones who owned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we've heard enough far along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you a little question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.30,0:03:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we spared your life, I bet your\Nparents don't give a damn about fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans think they're superior to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why there's no\Npoint in saving a so-called
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,innocent child because\Nall of them are guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll go home and\Nshe'll learn to hate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't stop until we stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we take them down a peg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen the way they\Nlook at us, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The fear, the contempt in their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were my decision, they would\Nall be five feet under right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Some humans, but hardly all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you need to look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is not the same as contempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because we're pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.92,0:05:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so afraid of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that our only exposure\Nto humans has been negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.60,0:05:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean we can\Njudge all humans the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear comes from ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Koala, let's play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,See if you can figure\Nout which hand it's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There, okay, guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Koala.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to bid the ship farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your home village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:06:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll walk you to the entrance at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go, koala!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can keep sailing with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good girl, even if you're human!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you pull it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell the whole village\Nhow great you guys are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let everyone know that\Nfishmen are nice and not scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you! So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You think she's cute now, but she'll be\Na fish man hating bigots soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong, you take that back. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Always so noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, you weren't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One girl telling her village that fish\Nmen are nice isn't gonna change a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like poor Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will listen and\Nno one will give a damn
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kozan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry. Don't tell her low.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't sneak off yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I won't forget\NHachi or Aladdin either!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we never see each other again,\Nand my heart will always be friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know these things happen slowly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but by the time you grow up,?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope our people can finally get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Fisher\NTiger of the Sun Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Rear Admiral Strawberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We were informed that you might\Nbe stopping on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl was property\Nof the Celestial Dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're going to look the\Nother way on that matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,at least for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the village elders were more than willing\Nto sell you out as long as we spared her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I'm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You must, so I won't waste your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is rather generous, all things\Nconsidered, but you're facing two charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Assault and escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the what in the hell\Nis going on it's from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the same direction boss\Nwas headed surely they
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't attack him look
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,out at sea we're surrounded
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing\Nhere? It was a damn trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The brat was nothing but\Na ploy to lure us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They played us for fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We show them an ounce of\Nkindness and this happens. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait no it must be tiger they want
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys guard the bow. I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,save the boss We finally agree when you\Nstop yapping and start throwing punches?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you won't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Arlhook, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship is gonna sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ship's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hijack one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this monster still fighting back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.48,0:12:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're plugging him full of bullets\Nand he's just shrugging it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You humans think I'm a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that noise, Mom? It was loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.26,0:12:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're admirals, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun Pirates came to save\NTiger. I see. It's him. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:13:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the one responsible for this?\NI do it all for justice and justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,demands I crush criminals like you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,curse you do you want to die with your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,captain you're not as strong as you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,think human we were able to rescue our
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,boss from the marines as planned and\Nalthough our ship was sunk during battle
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong was able to secure\Na new one from the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you\Ndon't want a transfusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.76,0:13:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost far too much blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever your feelings\Nare, you must reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss has a very rare blood type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No one on the crew is\Ncompatible, so we need another
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,option.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.67,0:13:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They have stalked on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it be from fishmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be... human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:13:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:13:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans and fishmen share the same blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We found your type as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's settled, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just relax. You're all good. Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I would rather die than\Nlive with their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't put that filth in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood of the bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who tried to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take their mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not owe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give in to any human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Something changed for you to say this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to tell\Nyou guys this, but I,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,on my last trip, that was quite\Na lengthy voyage you took.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, an eventful one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why are you\Nso adamant about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you see on your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw human nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.36,0:15:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after I started off on\Nmy journey, they captured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In Mariejois, they made me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,a damn slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw true human corruption,\Ntrue depravity, I barely escaped,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but then I kept thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,about those other slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:16:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so I went back, listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I lived how I chose to, against Oduhime's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still believe in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I still believe that she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and fishmen alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But our generation can't bring that peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're bound to an ugly past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Only children like Koala, free of\Nthat history, can change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you can't tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to hold it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our tragedy and our hatred,\Nthey must die with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Some humans are kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They know we're not so different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And because I've met so\Nmany compassionate humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize it's foolish to leave nothing\Nbut hatred as legacy when I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But even though my mind understands that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a devil in my\Nheart that cannot forgive,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that fills me with rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My very flesh rejects them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It rejects their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that I fought for,\NI cannot love them. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,However you feel you can\Nwork it out when this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,is all done for now I'm\Nbegging you just live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen boss you're a\Nhero those slaves that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.84,0:17:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you set free they owe\Nyou their very lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, boss, you can't\Ndie. Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To every slave and every\Nfishman, you're a symbol of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still not strong enough. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.50,0:18:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to step in front of your\Nmen with your whole body. Do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You protect them. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's no one else\Nwho can challenge me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the new leader of\Nthe fishman district.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all brothers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blood is my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I swear that I'll protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight for the\Nlives of every fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:18:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Tiger, but you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to die! A fish man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be from...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's awful noisy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Far along, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to start trouble that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too smart, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going after all the lousy\Nhumans who betrayed my captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Navy scum, can't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.54,0:20:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed Fisher Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to\Nme, but you deserve to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so your friend is dead, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can cry if you like, but\Neither way, you're coming with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong was enraged by\NBrother Tiger's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He took his anger out on humans\Nand was imprisoned as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There his hatred grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had a transfusion, he'd be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, he had to die, because\Nthey refused to treat fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought that little girl back to her\Nfamily, and you repaid that by killing him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher Tiger, captain of the Sun Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,dies after being denied a\Ntransfusion of human blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.86,0:21:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, though it is close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, the captain's dead,\Nand humans played a big role.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong lied to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger chose to save that girl\Ndespite his own prejudice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet humans still betrayed him, so he\Ncoldly refused to accept their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, he was a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of this became public, they\Nwould have attacked Tiger's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So let Arlong tell his little white lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss may not be with us, but we\Nstill have to keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.76,0:21:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:22:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow Tiger's wishes and\Ndo not kill anyone! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,From that day forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I bore the title First\NSon of the Sea and fought
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to do my best as Captain\Nof the Sun Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Though in truth, fighting seemed to\Nbe the only thing our crew was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am writing this because\NI thought the two of you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,deserved to know the whole\Ntruth about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.10,0:22:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Signed, Jinbe, Captain of the Sun Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind's made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.60,0:22:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, Fisher Tiger lived\Nthe only way that he knew how.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Saul, I finally understand\Nthe pain that he felt that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.38,0:22:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As their leader, I must remain strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.52,0:23:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.78,0:23:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We too shall live under the Sun\Nand try to understand one another!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.60,0:23:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may, signing here is the first\Nstep to harmony with all due respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We know, to he may, you\Nmust be out of your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher Tiger freed countless\Nslaves, both fishmen and human.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't care about what race they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet humans still refused to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about understanding another?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.76,0:23:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fruitless day without any signatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.96,0:23:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.76,0:23:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,really
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.71,0:23:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,need some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.63,0:23:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You children brighten my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, mother,\NI'll keep doing my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.76,0:24:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to make this world a\Nbetter place for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.76,0:24:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime was working\Nso hard, day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.42,0:24:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She rescued humans from shipwrecks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.06,0:24:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.72,0:24:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates must have hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.60,0:24:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.10,0:24:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the wounded to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.56,0:24:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She taught the island children\Nabout the world above.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.78,0:24:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anybody remember what this\Narea with many trees is called?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.82,0:24:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.60,0:24:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the sea forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.24,0:24:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And collected signatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.06,0:24:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.82,0:24:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need a moment of your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.62,0:24:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.53,0:25:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.54,0:25:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.66,0:25:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello again!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.12,0:25:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for showing your\Nsupport the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.30,0:25:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, about that, we're curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.24,0:25:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How many signatures do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.42,0:25:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've been collecting\Nthem for five years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred sheets have been signed,\Nwith each containing ten signatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.44,0:25:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So that adds up to one\Nthousand supporters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.60,0:25:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, the population of the island is\Nfive million, so we're not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Step by step, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.78,0:25:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, we have kind of a big favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to withdraw our signatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.04,0:25:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They total about half of what you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.84,0:25:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that sound okay? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.12,0:25:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not have heard about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.98,0:25:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but those human pirates that\Nyou rescued the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.28,0:25:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They committed a robbery in town\Nbefore escaping from the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.78,0:26:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.46,0:26:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.30,0:26:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.26,0:26:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for another lesson yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.44,0:26:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.30,0:26:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom wants that paper I\Nsigned the other day back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.30,0:26:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I do hope there's no hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.72,0:26:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What with you being the queen and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.72,0:26:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We just can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.56,0:26:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are too evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.90,0:26:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll pass on the speeches, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.74,0:26:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.74,0:26:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.60,0:26:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.16,0:26:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.48,0:27:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What an exhausting day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.62,0:27:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I might have\Noverdone it a bit out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.20,0:27:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sweeties, but could you\Ngive your mother some alone time today?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.80,0:27:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.64,0:27:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Liars!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.06,0:27:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is on the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.26,0:27:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.76,0:27:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.54,0:27:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.45,0:27:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,At the Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.08,0:27:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Majesty, have you been drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.60,0:27:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not drunk at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are. Goodness. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really Queen Otohime?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.98,0:28:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody better listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.82,0:28:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can live however you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.42,0:28:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If that means staying in this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.86,0:28:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then I can't stop you,\Nneither can anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.00,0:28:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the vastness of\Nthe ocean, so broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.50,0:28:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And on the sea floor, foreboding and dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.26,0:28:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We chose this tiny place\Nand this place alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.66,0:28:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.08,0:28:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime, isn't it because this\Nis where we can get a bit of sunlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where we can get a bit of air?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.56,0:28:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Luxuries down here are\Nplentiful above ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Light illuminates the entire surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.88,0:28:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and the sky stretches out\Nas far as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.56,0:29:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our children, why do they always\Nsneak out to catch a glimpse of Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.62,0:29:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see the world is filled with
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.90,0:29:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,more beauty than any\Nof us can even imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no place that we shouldn't be able
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.90,0:29:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to go why restrict\Nourselves to this bubble?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.20,0:29:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you tell yourselves life down\Nhere is comfortable but you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.24,0:29:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to spend the\Nrest of your lives trapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.14,0:29:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,dig deep summon your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.58,0:29:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you have it pursue\Nyour dreams no matter
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.12,0:29:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the cost your majesty if\Nhumans stand in your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.16,0:29:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll face them together you don't have to\Nconfront your fears alone and maybe then?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finally make a difference for the\Nfuture, for our children, for the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.36,0:30:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's just a small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.98,0:30:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, you've seen better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.76,0:30:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He was formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.98,0:30:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.04,0:30:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He certainly did a\Nnumber on you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.24,0:30:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong, the fishman that we just locked\Nup and impelled down, he was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.22,0:30:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have to watch out for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.74,0:30:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.10,0:30:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's quite strong, even\Nby fishman standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.92,0:30:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's far too dangerous at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.10,0:30:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We should bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.34,0:30:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.25,0:30:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and the seven warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.80,0:30:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not that surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.72,0:31:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worth $250 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.04,0:31:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,With a bounty that big, they definitely see\Nyou as a threat to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.90,0:31:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the highest praise a\Npirate can get from those chumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.20,0:31:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mackerel's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.11,0:31:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're finally taking us seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.32,0:31:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is reject them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.34,0:31:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll really help us\Npile on the notoriety.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.22,0:31:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will ever mess with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.72,0:31:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind is made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.98,0:31:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take the navy's offer! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.04,0:31:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.58,0:31:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about the seven\Nwarlords' proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.38,0:31:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I join,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.62,0:31:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Aladdin and the other crew members Who do
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.60,0:31:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,not wish to be pirates\NNo longer have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.00,0:31:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They can live in this country\Nwithout fear of retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.96,0:31:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a way for me to take care of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.98,0:31:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly If\NI do become a warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.26,0:31:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It will help the fishermen become\Ncloser to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.86,0:31:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We need that relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.00,0:31:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can atone for all the trouble\Nthat we've caused the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.06,0:31:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.98,0:32:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,At the moment, she's\Nnot feeling very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.46,0:32:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, we might see Tiger's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.90,0:32:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Liberation and freedom for\Nall fishermen, everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.08,0:32:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, then again, we\Nhave to watch our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.34,0:32:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some less deserving of amnesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.44,0:32:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.48,0:32:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really new!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.42,0:32:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So good to have your back, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.92,0:32:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have something to say to\Nme, then you'd better speak up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.76,0:32:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you expect to thank\Nme for becoming a sellout.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.66,0:32:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have set me free,\Nbut the Navy owns you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.18,0:32:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten what\NBrother Ty said before he died?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.80,0:32:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't let anger and\Nbitterness overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.28,0:33:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds to me like you've gotten soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.84,0:33:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'd probably be safer\Nif I followed your lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.42,0:33:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no way in hell I'm doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.46,0:33:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't make me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.50,0:33:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you forgot, Tiger is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.88,0:33:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.90,0:33:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Free to lead my own crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.58,0:33:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if you'll excuse me,\NI'll be taking back my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.50,0:33:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.74,0:33:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn ignorant fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, enough with the name code.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.04,0:33:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.32,0:33:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.14,0:33:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.05,0:33:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.58,0:33:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't do it, I'm free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.36,0:33:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.70,0:33:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go down easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.28,0:33:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.34,0:33:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrogant Paul!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.72,0:33:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.34,0:33:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.32,0:34:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.84,0:34:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jimmy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.54,0:34:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dwell on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.16,0:34:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing you could have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.04,0:34:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've known each other\Nsince childhood, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.58,0:34:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Like him or not, he's still\Nlike a brother to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.14,0:34:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're no killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.10,0:34:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's blinded by hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.04,0:34:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.32,0:34:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What tiger meant by his dying\Nwords it doesn't matter how
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.12,0:34:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,far he goes as long as arlong\Nengages in violence the navy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.88,0:34:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,will be after him worst comes\Nto worst we may have to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.20,0:34:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,arlong ourselves one day at\Nany cost only time will tell
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.16,0:35:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,look i'd love to stay and chat\Ncaptain jean bay but we're
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,headed out to good luck you're\Ngonna need it macro come
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.88,0:35:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,back here i want to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.56,0:35:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Little so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.98,0:35:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,suckers damn it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.34,0:35:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he's stronger than i realized\Nyou archie you can't look back
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.44,0:35:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the sun pirates split into three\Ngroups with our long macro and myself
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.90,0:35:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,as captains and ever since then we\Nhave continued going our separate ways
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.56,0:35:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
